# Leyline of Resonance copies only a spell that targets a creature you control. Lightning Bolt at Bot2 has no creature as a target, so the
# Bolt is the only thing on the stack (positive control: the Bolt at Bot1's own Elves, in leyline-of-resonance-copy-of-lightning-bolt-may-be-aimed-at-a-new-target).

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
